# Kept out of ripgrep's searches, and so out of the search and file-listing
# tools AI agents use: third-party source a search through the tree almost
# never wants (about 1,000 files). Git does not read this file. To search
# there, name the ignored directory itself or one inside it
# (`rg PATTERN vendor`, `rg PATTERN ports/doomgeneric/source`), or pass
# `--no-ignore`; naming `ports/doomgeneric` alone still skips its `source/`.
/vendor/
/ports/*/source/
